      "passageSha256": "b912d0727b07c67cffc10251d3c744e153b0eeab4ec19a15da82c7a666136462",
      "pdfPages": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0073",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-s007",
      "sentenceText": "You did a bunch of extracurricular activities.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ca474d87aee0f19cf2353be193ed3effb8715594973fcd648322aa51cdacbf2d",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-069",
      "parentFingerprint": "2bb06d9537c6294ff8477cada11102b05503045ef8a83ff48424e5c5aa52f29d",
      "passageSha256": "b912d0727b07c67cffc10251d3c744e153b0eeab4ec19a15da82c7a666136462",
      "pdfPages": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0074",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-s012",
      "sentenceText": "Now, let’s say you’re a satisficer.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5788ae1dc37c80527cc585ded61706d3d6559b32d99e08ca14634a3d7d22deeb",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-r012-016",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "dcb28b50d7361fa116af07e24ab51901e38ff0cd0f417c58139b5492485e9003",
      "passageSha256": "d443ba05202c1f3a5dd74dd0dac9ac12be63f64b8e103ef9699784b067b9103b",
      "pdfPages": [
        23,
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0075",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-s013",
      "sentenceText": "You could probably get into one of the Ivies or other super elite schools like Duke.",
      "sentenceSha256": "da4dabea3381dbfeebec04b667f367af11e3b8865b3d45059caf4bdc902ac38d",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-r012-016",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "dcb28b50d7361fa116af07e24ab51901e38ff0cd0f417c58139b5492485e9003",
      "passageSha256": "d443ba05202c1f3a5dd74dd0dac9ac12be63f64b8e103ef9699784b067b9103b",
      "pdfPages": [
        23,
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0076",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-s014",
      "sentenceText": "But instead you say, “I think the University of Virginia has everything I want.",
      "sentenceSha256": "311d26fe14b8898f2f689e63e5fa852966dd95b5c70db91ab2d797fe7dcf5203",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-r012-016",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "dcb28b50d7361fa116af07e24ab51901e38ff0cd0f417c58139b5492485e9003",
      "passageSha256": "d443ba05202c1f3a5dd74dd0dac9ac12be63f64b8e103ef9699784b067b9103b",
      "pdfPages": [
        23,
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0077",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-s015",
      "sentenceText": "Plus, I get in-state tuition.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "1ce391d293824b6d9895b9c90454dbedeed6696e57ae562b96b47e59d196c376",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p023-05160-r012-016",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "dcb28b50d7361fa116af07e24ab51901e38ff0cd0f417c58139b5492485e9003",
      "passageSha256": "d443ba05202c1f3a5dd74dd0dac9ac12be63f64b8e103ef9699784b067b9103b",
      "pdfPages": [
        23,
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0078",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-01335-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Let’s assume one of the maximizers got into Cornell while the satisficer went to UVA.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5eb80352872aebc014b3d5ea69d07dfeff2d7a814edfe8b9b21a7f4aef34828c",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-01335-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-071",
      "parentFingerprint": "3cbff14c2cabea44790d39e2e9a97395987b69921f5ba60e4a1cafe323c3a93f",
      "passageSha256": "c5d00fdd70f7001e174659d7fd61fdb982dd7188e7df4dce152d17204af33899",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0079",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-01335-s002",
      "sentenceText": "At the end of the first year, which one is likely to be happier?",
      "sentenceSha256": "4a813424d48d8afa3122c11780859372890171b77ffde7a4cb5f41cd2e7a9a16",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-01335-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-071",
      "parentFingerprint": "3cbff14c2cabea44790d39e2e9a97395987b69921f5ba60e4a1cafe323c3a93f",
      "passageSha256": "c5d00fdd70f7001e174659d7fd61fdb982dd7188e7df4dce152d17204af33899",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0080",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-01335-s009",
      "sentenceText": "No alternative, no counterfactual, no regret.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7d6f023c525e253d59ece3838c53e883d8f5d3d7ccd03053fbbf3909122bbab9",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-01335-r006-009",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-072",
      "parentFingerprint": "4a4bf64ca5793ba1955fc060e5b184c1ff08f990785a0721cb3b584896cac7d0",
      "passageSha256": "7ae2962548217d8d86d05a5c8716fd8cd7adf703882c7ee49b1a40e4a7855c29",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0081",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-01335-s012",
      "sentenceText": "Easier said than done, but that will make you happier.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ee25b31538589911739e8dfae0d8c804f804e667ddd92640f3e4243c8c91c2fa",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-01335-r010-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-073",
      "parentFingerprint": "d781579da6cc044059f1962f6e639a2d1f594dafc44ef668e670647d802b5a59",
      "passageSha256": "d1e7d0c9f286d0639beb8f21d1782e3c42a2c0643aaa746b7b2ce6855246a6b3",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0082",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Jim Clark, who cofounded Netscape, had a series of successes as a Silicon Valley entrepreneur.",
      "sentenceSha256": "65015ae9ea8395bd94aacd27f82b593150ce6ebe9d2b5aef81662bbee1a66430",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-r001-002",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-074",
      "parentFingerprint": "a5122c2be91a99c52e7ebc53011d05f2d661968d131225a88e37148fccfba405",
      "passageSha256": "0371595cd8da9903e5431f9c4255e23803e3b3c223567b53c9aea3630b619e5d",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0083",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-s003",
      "sentenceText": "He recounted to journalist Michael Lewis how he had initially thought he would be happy if he made $10 million early on.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7ac1736bc6b2df635c4c3f21ce3601bb4ce655539211be70b8a0aa7046f20d4a",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-r003-009",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "160ad822efc1fe0f6cecd4c8a64e91e377cbe31d07eae101d4a01ab8fa95fd38",
      "passageSha256": "26523a5da8027dbecfb179a31255bef8877338d0a4fe98de6b7850b1a5754800",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0084",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-s004",
      "sentenceText": "But then Netscape was a smashing success.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f800d56bba3caaffcd11ef836fd1a8ad8fbd41444e51cf7cdfae0a94311624d4",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-r003-009",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "160ad822efc1fe0f6cecd4c8a64e91e377cbe31d07eae101d4a01ab8fa95fd38",
      "passageSha256": "26523a5da8027dbecfb179a31255bef8877338d0a4fe98de6b7850b1a5754800",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0085",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-s006",
      "sentenceText": "But then there was another smashing success, and he now thought he would be really happy if he made $1 billion.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7bebdbee251aec2c1b000ece3f9fb7a36f862228dddaa9384c289f0a846e5d56",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-r003-009",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "160ad822efc1fe0f6cecd4c8a64e91e377cbe31d07eae101d4a01ab8fa95fd38",
      "passageSha256": "26523a5da8027dbecfb179a31255bef8877338d0a4fe98de6b7850b1a5754800",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0086",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Then he did make $1 billion.",
      "sentenceSha256": "eede82dd5e58409274d7aaf87a2ac971dd652b24390e702a42a73f9ec0ccd80b",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-r003-009",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "160ad822efc1fe0f6cecd4c8a64e91e377cbe31d07eae101d4a01ab8fa95fd38",
      "passageSha256": "26523a5da8027dbecfb179a31255bef8877338d0a4fe98de6b7850b1a5754800",
      "pdfPages": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0087",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-s010",
      "sentenceText": "According to Forbes, in 2023 Clark’s net worth was $3.8 billion, while Larry Ellison’s net worth was $158 billion.",
      "sentenceSha256": "393354b75dac9662e0a6bd093c063257d0d5ee3576032659e87bb9c7497fcc4b",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-r010-013",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-075",
      "parentFingerprint": "3bb5412a620aeb74df99d206c378e91414ea0360063286a8f0a4804ef30683d9",
      "passageSha256": "b6b963f4793e4f9f86852d1c6f9ce685c3b6437a78fe640392c79281d2f1bc16",
      "pdfPages": [
        24,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0088",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-s011",
      "sentenceText": "I wonder if Jim Clark has ever gotten his satisfaction, despite his enormous success.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e580760cfb72c8114cc9b62973d8a46a406d0d6be48e5f2a6a580a96e0e2d4a7",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-r010-013",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-075",
      "parentFingerprint": "3bb5412a620aeb74df99d206c378e91414ea0360063286a8f0a4804ef30683d9",
      "passageSha256": "b6b963f4793e4f9f86852d1c6f9ce685c3b6437a78fe640392c79281d2f1bc16",
      "pdfPages": [
        24,
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c02-0089",
      "sentenceId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-s012",
      "sentenceText": "On this point, research findings are very clear.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c043e0014b6b191f00cbbb451d3e798b0872845ade9bae2175578667aa1e987d",
      "readingUnitId": "c02-s05-p024-04455-r010-013",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c02-075",
      "parentFingerprint": "3bb5412a620aeb74df99d206c378e91414ea0360063286a8f0a4804ef30683d9",
      "passageSha256": "b6b963f4793e4f9f86852d1c6f9ce685c3b6437a78fe640392c79281d2f1bc16",
      "pdfPages": [
        24,
